# Ordo Carnis Truncatae Equipment
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetNigWebAlguacil = Galea Censoria
    .desc = A heavy ornate visor helmet worn by the leaders and zealots of the Ordo Carnis Truncatae.

ent-ClothingOuterArmorNigWebAlguacil = Lorica Martyrum
    .desc = Heavy plate armor of the sacred martyrs, consecrated with the prayers of the Flayed Lady.

ent-WeaponGunNigWebSparq = sparq beam
    .desc = A pseudo-taser designed to administer pain. Lots of pain.

# Shared Equipment (used by garrison / residents)
ent-ClothingUniformNigWebWarrior = warrior uniform
    .desc = Made of sturdy fabric, tailored to be worn comfortably beneath heavy plate armor.

ent-ClothingShoesNigWebJackboots = jackboots
    .desc = High-laced heavy leather boots. Standard issue for the fortress garrison.

ent-ClothingHandsGlovesNigWebSteel = steel gauntlets
    .desc = Sturdy gauntlets made of steel, lined with leather.

ent-ClothingBackpackSatchelNigWeb = leather satchel
    .desc = A rugged leather satchel made to carry rations and writs.


# Cenobiarca (Inquisitor)
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetNigWebChariot = chariot helm
    .desc = A heavy horned iron battle-helm with a narrow visor slit. An emblem of the unyielding march of the Church.

ent-ClothingMaskGasNigWebVeteran = veteran church gas mask
    .desc = Consecrated tactical gas mask of the Church veterans. Its ocular lenses ominously blaze red upon entering combat mode.

ent-ClothingHeadHatNigWebInquisitor = inquisitor hat
    .desc = The wide-brimmed leather hat of the High Inquisitor of the Ordo Carnis Truncatae. Casts a heavy shadow over the wearer's gaze.

ent-ClothingOuterCoatNigWebInquisitor = grand inquisitor coat
    .desc = An ornate, heavy armored greatcoat lined with steel plates and silver fastenings, consecrated with sacred oils.

ent-ClothingNeckNigWebOldCross = ancient golden cross
    .desc = A heavy consecrated pectoral cross of the Inquisition suspended on an iron chain, warding the flesh and soul of its bearer.

ent-ClothingUniformNigWebChurch = church robes
    .desc = Somber black church garb of the Ordo Carnis Truncatae clergy, shrouding the scars and sins of the faithful.

ent-ClothingShoesNigWebInquisitor = inquisitor boots
    .desc = Polished heavy black leather boots. Steps taken in them resonate with grim authority.

# Iatrosophista (Esculap Surgeon)
ent-ClothingHeadHatNigWebIatrosophista = esculap hat
    .desc = A specialized liturgical doctor's cap, steeped in herb infusions and wax to ward off foul miasmas.

ent-ClothingOuterCoatNigWebIatrosophista = esculap robes
    .desc = A heavy anatomical robe worn by sacred surgeons, stained with ritual tinctures and holy salves.

ent-ClothingUniformNigWebPracticus = practicus tunic
    .desc = A woven linen tunic worn by medical acolytes of the Order.

ent-ClothingShoesNigWebIatrosophista = practicus boots
    .desc = Soft leather boots designed for silent pacing across hospice halls among the dying.

# Calycifer (Thanati Acolyte)
ent-ClothingHeadHoodNigWebCalycifer = thanati hood
    .desc = A deep black cowl that veils the face of the chalice-bearer during bloody sacraments.

ent-ClothingOuterRobesNigWebThanati = thanati robes
    .desc = Funerary vestments of a Thanati acolyte, smelling of bitter incense and dried blood.

ent-ClothingUniformNigWebCalycifer = consyte hairshirt
    .desc = A coarse penitent tunic worn against bare skin as an offering of suffering to the Lady.

ent-ClothingShoesNigWebCalycifer = acolyte shoes
    .desc = Simple worn leather shoes, walked thin through catacomb pilgrimages.

ent-NigWebChalice = communion chalice
    .desc = An ancient sacred chalice engraved with the faces of martyrs. Used to collect sacred fluids and blood.

ent-WeaponMeleeNigWebSacrificialDagger = sacrificial dagger
    .desc = A razor-sharp sacrificial stiletto grooved for bloodletting, inscribed with the vows of the Order.

# Parabalani (Shock Zealot)
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetNigWebParabalani = parabalani helmet
    .desc = A heavy iron close-helm with a cruciform visor slit. Obstructs peripheral vision but turns aside mortal blows.

ent-ClothingOuterArmorNigWebParabalani = parabalani armor
    .desc = A monolithic suit of Marduk plate forged to shatter enemy battle-lines in the Lady's name.

ent-ClothingUniformNigWebParabalani = ordinator gambeson
    .desc = A dense padded gambeson worn under plate armor to absorb blunt trauma.

ent-ClothingShoesNigWebParabalaniIron = parabalani iron boots
    .desc = Heavy steel-shod boots. Every step strikes the earth like the march of doom itself.
